      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "首次 5 文件：Gateway 2、依赖 2、测试 1。\ngateway/bridge/client.py 薄接 ACP SDK；\n持续 I/O loop、回调、恢复、取消与清理。\n不重写 JSON-RPC 或 provider 适配器。",
      "originalText": "首次 5 文件：Gateway 2、依赖 2、测试 1。\ngateway/bridge/client.py 薄接 ACP SDK；\n持续 I/O loop、回调、恢复、取消与清理。\n不重写 JSON-RPC 或 provider 适配器。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "customData": {
        "stageId": "P01",
        "field": "改动"
      }
